Package: BOSTON
Type: Package
Title: Spatially Variable Feature Detection for Sparse Spatial Omics Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Yuhan", "Zhao", email = "yuhanZhao@stu.xjtu.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Shiquan", "Sun", email = "sqsunsph@xjtu.edu.cn", role = "aut"))
Description: Detects spatially variable features in sparse spatial omics data
    with a binomial mixed-model score test. BOSTON binarizes feature counts,
    evaluates five Gaussian spatial kernels selected from the observed spatial
    sampling geometry, and combines kernel-specific p-values using ACAT.
URL: https://github.com/Santanevrgivup/BOSTON
